=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">烘焙度：</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">浅度 Light Roasted</span></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">建议养豆：2周起</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">风味</span><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">：百香果、人参果、咖啡花香、葡萄干</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">         Passionfruit, Pepino, Coffee Blossom, Raisin sweetness-finish</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">这只豆子也很神奇，入口是发酵不重的热带水果像百香果的果香接人参果的甜香气，中段会有很清新的花香有点洋甘菊的甜香又有咖啡花和接骨木花的香气，还延续蛮久，然后再一口随着温度的下降又会感受到西梅干葡萄干果干的那种甜；</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><span \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 14px;letter-spacing:=\"\" 255);text-decoration:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;font-size:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" underline;\"=\"\" wrap;background-color:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\">区域：阿比高娜 Arbegona</span></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: underline;\">处理站/村：杜婉丘 Duwancho</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: none;\">（生豆商伙伴的采购清单里，埃塞那边提供的信息里它是归类在Bura Woreda下面的，但是很多外网烘焙商网站以及这个产季的另外一只Duwancho蜜处理都显示Duwancho是位于Arbegona Woreda下面的,参见我们另外单独一篇关于Duwancho的推文）</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">海拔：2280 - 2360 米</span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">烘焙度：</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">浅度 Light Roasted</span></spa