if;font-size: 14px;\">          Loquart, Mango, Orange, Nectarine, Pineapple</span></section><section \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;background-color:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">超级开心一个产季里第二次选到同一处理站，不同处理方式的豆子，这一支日晒最大的特点是多汁，是那种爽脆的多汁水果的感觉；高温入口是果香为主调，枇杷复合橙子芦柑（酸甜口的）还有一些咖啡花香，中后段在口中咀嚼时特别果汁感，像油桃+菠萝在一起咬下去爆汁感，甜感也敲级饱满~好喝！！！</span></section><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;background-color:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QHqot5OHQdDD6X3lDgDRgySsvq6VOw94MsrnvenibrCA7TCtqm5u1ffvkc44OIFmV8me2goicAX53w/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" wrap;background-color:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sidama大州下面的小区分布，可以参考Bensa/Arbegona/Bursa/Bona Zuriya这几个近两年开始逐渐在国内出现频率多的村镇位置</span></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" wrap;background-color:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-align:=\"\" 14px;letter-spacing:=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;font-size:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" start;\"=\"\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" wrap;background-color:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">关于这3个批次</span></strong></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" wrap;line-height:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">这3个批次都是来自于一个埃塞出口商，是和ALO同为这两年后起之秀的Karamo Coffee Export，由Nigusse Gemeda Mude于2017年成立；</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2020年埃塞的第一次CoE赛事里，Nigusse的咖啡获得了冠军，2021年获得第25名，2022年的第28名；</span>虽然<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">后两次成绩不是很好，但可以看出来他的产品已经可以很稳定的高质量生产供应给市场；</span></span></p><p \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;text-wrap:=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);line-height:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" wrap;background-color:=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">从这几个豆子的采购清单上看他们来自于不同的小村落，Agena村这一个Lot名字是Karamo，不确定它们之间的关系和从属，暂时就用Agena来命名这个豆子，未来有更新再更正哈。</span></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Qayf5JLggdHa4HfhMfCicBibkBqNPDwK99OuHLXNaxAAQUw2thp9PNqia4xsQUbgibYnrfIwxzXsUmGA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Qayf5JLggdHa4HfhMfCicBibZDf84GmOG47UK6nYKzJWZbHcpWQZpeMmxWW7dwQnoNw1Nibb5YCspCw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/><span \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"></span></p><section \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" arial,=\"\" center;line-height:=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;text-align:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更多咖啡豆，请关注淘宝店铺哈</span></section><section \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);text-align:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" center;line-height:=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;background-color:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息</span></section><section \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 1.75em;\"=\"\" 255);text-align:=\"\" 255,=\"\" arial,=\"\" center;line-height:=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;background-color:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-wrap: wrap;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" \"pingfang=\"\" 0.544px;font-size:=\"\" 14px;\"=\"\" arial,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\">客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></span></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>",
